    ],
    "text": "Executive Summary"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000012",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0002",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0003-n0002-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      3
    ],
    "text": "Dear Chief of Police,"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000013",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0003-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0004-l0000"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0004-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0005-l0000"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0002",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0003-n0003-l0000",
      "p0003-n0004-l0000",
      "p0003-n0005-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      3
    ],
    "text": "We have developed a model to help aid you in investigations regarding serial criminals. I am writing to inform you of its functionality and what cases are most appropriate for its uses."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000014",
    "issues": [
      "hyphen_join_review"
    ],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0006-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0007-l0000"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0007-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0008-l0000"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0008-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0009-l0000"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0009-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0010-l0000"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0010-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0011-l0000"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0011-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0012-l0000"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0012-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0013-l0000"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0013-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0014-l0000"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0002",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0003-n0006-l0000",
      "p0003-n0007-l0000",
      "p0003-n0008-l0000",
      "p0003-n0009-l0000",
      "p0003-n0010-l0000",
      "p0003-n0011-l0000",
      "p0003-n0012-l0000",
      "p0003-n0013-l0000",
      "p0003-n0014-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      3
    ],
    "text": "Our model requires input from any member of your squad of the time and loca- tions, in latitude and longitude, of the criminal acts you suspect were committed by any speci\ufb01c criminal. It then uses the locations of these points, along with a function modeling the drop o\ufb00in probability as the distance from the crime site increases, to generate a probability distribution of the criminal\u2019s location. Further, it creates a probability distribution of possible future crime scenes by \ufb01guring out which point would be least surprising in future probability distribution calculations. Overall, it tends to guess the locations relatively accurately, especially when it comes to future crimes."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000015",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0015-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0016-l0000"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0016-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0017-l0000"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0017-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0018-l0000"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0018-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0019-l0000"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0002",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0003-n0015-l0000",
      "p0003-n0016-l0000",
      "p0003-n0017-l0000",
      "p0003-n0018-l0000",
      "p0003-n0019-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      3
    ],
    "text": "Unfortunately, our model is not a godsend. It assumes that all input on a given run is for a single criminal, even though its inherent clustering could provide relevant data in the case of multiple criminals. Similarly, we assume that the killer has just one base location from which he or she operates. Our model does not work well for commuter criminals, or those driving long distances in order to commit crimes."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000016",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0020-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0021-l0000"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0021-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0022-l0000"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0022-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0023-l0000"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0002",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0003-n0020-l0000",
      "p0003-n0021-l0000",
      "p0003-n0022-l0000",
      "p0003-n0023-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      3
    ],
    "text": "Additionally, it relies on the hypothesis that the probability of the criminal\u2019s base being at a given location decreases as you move away from the crime scenes. Furthermore, the model ignores any variations in terrain and in population density, instead assuming that they are both homogeneous."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000017",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0002",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0003-n0024-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      3
    ],
    "text": "Despite these obvious drawbacks, our model does have many strengths. In addi-"
